===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To send a message to; to [[transmit]] a message to, [[e.g.]] as [[text message|text]] via a cell phone.
#: {{ux|en|Just '''message''' me for directions.}}
#: {{ux|en|I '''messaged''' her about the concert.}}
# To send (something) as a message; usually refers to electronic messaging.
#: {{ux|en|She '''messaged''' me the information yesterday.}}
#: {{ux|en|Please '''message''' the final report by fax.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To send a message or messages; to be capable of sending messages.
#: {{ux|en|We've implemented a new '''messaging''' service.}}
#: {{ux|en|The runaway computer program was '''messaging''' non-stop.}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} To [[bear]] as a message.

